00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:38.350
My Chromebook is not working.

00:09:42.913 --> 00:09:45.510
And let's start with that.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.360
And let's test it now.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:50.680
So I'm going to
take this example,

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:51.950
