00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.090
Oh, OK, so that's great.

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:10.730
So what you see is it identified
an intent that is service.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.740
And it identified a
parameter name Product

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.260
