00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.520
Now let's add a response.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:21.440
Let's say, sure, no problem.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:30.650
Dispatching service
for product right away.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.615
Save.

00:10:31.615 --> 00:10:34.420
And let's test it.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:41.190
Can I please fix my Chromecast?

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:43.050
And you can see, it
says, sure, no problem.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:46.480
Dispatching service from
Chromecast right away.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.040
And if I click on
Show JSON, you can

