00:12:12.317 --> 00:12:14.025
And let's give it a
couple more examples.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:22.352
Can I buy seven Chromebooks?

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:32.420
Please get me two Pixels.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.640
OK, so it looks
