00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.630
Let's just show
it the full thing.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:08.355
And then let's
just mark quantity.

00:13:08.355 --> 00:13:09.480
And I'm going to save this.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.485
And let's add a response.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:31.840
Adding quantity, product,
and sending to address.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:35.158
I think this one we don't need.

00:13:35.158 --> 00:13:37.894
Let's delete it.

00:13:37.894 --> 00:13:39.255
And let's save.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.180
And let's test it out.

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:48.920
Let's say, can I
buy five Pixels?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:14:00.715
OK, let me try, I'd like
to buy five Pixels, please.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:07.500
OK, you can see the Intent,
it recognizes commerce.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.280
It got that it's a Pixel.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.440
