00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.370
Can I buy five Pixels?

00:14:56.370 --> 00:15:00.720
Oh, there was a
spelling mistake here.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:04.240
Maybe that's why it didn't work.

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:10.990
But I can go back and actually
assign this training data

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.200
