00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:29.050
And Pixel should
have been a product.

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:31.750
I can mark it with a checkmark.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:36.170
And then from now on, it's going
to add that to the examples

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:37.390
