00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:43.310
And then this one
should be Commerce.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:48.950
Quantity.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:52.390
But I want to track this.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:56.000
And Pixels is the product.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.620
And checked.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.320
I'm going to approve it.

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:05.500
And now let's try another one.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:12.530
