00:30:42.180 --> 00:30:44.246
And yeah, that's fine.

00:30:44.246 --> 00:30:46.120
But let's stick to the
activate holiday mode.

00:30:49.650 --> 00:30:52.680
I have prepared
some [INAUDIBLE].

00:30:52.680 --> 00:30:55.790
And yeah, then I
show this already.

00:30:55.790 --> 00:30:57.280
And I want to
require a parameter.

00:30:57.280 --> 00:30:58.920
It's the date period.

00:30:58.920 --> 00:31:02.190
And then I have switched on
the WebHook for the [INAUDIBLE]

00:31:02.190 --> 00:31:03.690
presentation.

00:31:03.690 --> 00:31:07.200
And I want to use it here.

00:31:12.940 --> 00:31:17.350
And now I take the
JSON here, which

00:31:17.350 --> 00:31:21.590
is processed, and copy it out.

00:31:21.590 --> 00:31:23.515
And then keep this in mind.

00:31:23.515 --> 00:31:26.630
And now I switch to our
back end implementation.

00:31:26.630 --> 00:31:28.640
Oh, my VM is switched off.

00:31:28.640 --> 00:31:32.420
So let's be patient till
