00:31:32.420 --> 00:31:35.760
So we are developing
our back ends .NET.

00:31:42.090 --> 00:31:46.740
And we're using Visual
Studio for that.

00:31:46.740 --> 00:31:52.564
And it was really easy
for us to use API.AI.

00:31:52.564 --> 00:31:54.125
Oh, sorry for that.

