00:32:16.110 --> 00:32:19.290
OK, how to integrate
within a .NET solution.

00:32:19.290 --> 00:32:23.580
I have a Web API
project up and running.

00:32:23.580 --> 00:32:28.530
And the first thing I have to
do is I use the NuGet Package

