00:32:39.840 --> 00:32:42.210
for everything.

00:32:42.210 --> 00:32:43.540
So that's the first thing.

00:32:43.540 --> 00:32:46.080
I added that NuGet package.

00:32:46.080 --> 00:32:48.960
Then I prepare my controller.

00:32:48.960 --> 00:32:51.960
Here you have the root
prefix of that controller,

00:32:51.960 --> 00:32:53.430
which receives them.

