as your intention is

00:52:47.300 --> 00:52:50.480
for it to remember what
everyone else is saying,

00:52:50.480 --> 00:52:51.695
then you're good to go.

00:52:51.695 --> 00:52:53.570
Then it doesn't change
anything in the logic.

